<!doctype html><html lang="sw"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>API Docs | Konekti Malipo</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>:root{--ink:#10221d;--cream:#f7f6ef;--muted:#65766e;--line:#dce5dc;--lime:#c6f04b;--teal:#147b67}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:Manrope,Arial}.shell{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}nav{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:800}.mark{width:31px;height:31px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--lime);border-radius:10px 10px 3px 10px;font-size:22px}.links{display:flex;gap:18px}.back{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal)}main{padding:54px 0 90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;gap:55px}.sidebar{position:sticky;top:24px;height:max-content}.sidebar b{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--teal);text-transform:uppercase}.sidebar a{display:block;margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.content{max-width:760px}.eyebrow{font:12px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--teal);text-transform:uppercase}h1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2.5px;margin:14px 0}h2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:52px 0 13px}.lead,p{line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}.lead{font-size:17px}.card{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fffefa;margin:20px 0}.method{font:12px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#107556;font-weight:800}.route{font:14px 'DM Mono',monospace;margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink)}pre{overflow:auto;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;background:#10221d;color:#d1e0d7;font:12px/1.8 'DM Mono',monospace}.lime{color:#d8fa73}.mint{color:#88dac2}.note{border-left:4px solid var(--lime);padding:13px 16px;background:#eff5e3;color:#456254;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px}code{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;color:#147b67}@media(max-width:700px){.shell{padding:0 20px}main{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.sidebar{position:static;display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sidebar a{margin:0}h1{font-size:39px}}</style></head><body><div class="shell"><nav><a class="brand" href="{{ route('dashboard') }}"><span class="mark">↗</span>Konekti Malipo</a><div class="links"><a class="back" href="{{ route('api-keys.index') }}">API keys</a><a class="back" href="{{ route('dashboard') }}">← Dashboard</a></div></nav><main><aside class="sidebar"><b>On this page</b><a href="#auth">Authentication</a><a href="#payments">Create payment</a><a href="#webhooks">Webhooks</a><a href="#statuses">Payment statuses</a><a href="#expiry">Expiry & cancellation</a></aside><article class="content"><span class="eyebrow">Developer documentation</span><h1>Accept payments with one integration.</h1><p class="lead">Tumia Konekti Malipo kuanzisha hosted checkout ya Pesapal, kupokea callback, na kuthibitisha payment server-side.</p><div class="note">Kabla ya kutumia API, connect Pesapal account kwenye dashboard. IPN ID inasajiliwa automatically, na credentials zako hubaki encrypted.</div><h2 id="auth">Authentication</h2><p>Tengeneza key kwenye <a href="{{ route('api-keys.index') }}">API keys</a>. Key huonekana mara moja tu. Tuma kwenye server-to-server request—usiweke key kwenye JavaScript au mobile app ya public.</p><pre>Authorization: Bearer <span class="lime">km_live_your_secret_key</span>
<span class="faded"># au</span>
X-API-Key: <span class="lime">km_live_your_secret_key</span></pre><h2 id="payments">Create payment</h2><p>Endpoint inahitaji API key na <code>account_id</code> ya Pesapal account iliyounganishwa kwenye dashboard.</p><div class="card"><div class="method">POST</div><div class="route">/api/payments</div></div><pre>{
  <span class="mint">"account_id"</span>: 1,
  <span class="mint">"gateway"</span>: <span class="lime">"pesapal"</span>,
  <span class="mint">"amount"</span>: 50000,
  <span class="mint">"currency"</span>: <span class="lime">"TZS"</span>,
  <span class="mint">"description"</span>: <span class="lime">"Order #1001"</span>,
  <span class="mint">"merchant_reference"</span>: <span class="lime">"ORDER-1001"</span>,
  <span class="mint">"customer"</span>: { <span class="mint">"name"</span>: <span class="lime">"Asha Juma"</span>, <span class="mint">"email"</span>: <span class="lime">"asha@example.com"</span>, <span class="mint">"phone"</span>: <span class="lime">"2557..."</span> }
}</pre><p>Response ina <code>checkout_url</code>. I-load kwenye modal/iframe au redirect browser. Payment inabaki <code>pending</code> hadi Pesapal ithibitishe.</p><pre>{
  <span class="mint">"success"</span>: true,
  <span class="mint">"payment_id"</span>: <span class="lime">"01..."</span>,
  <span class="mint">"status"</span>: <span class="lime">"pending"</span>,
  <span class="mint">"checkout_url"</span>: <span class="lime">"https://pay.pesapal.com/..."</span>
}</pre><h2 id="webhooks">Callbacks & IPN</h2><p>Pesapal hutuma IPN kwenye endpoint ya account husika. System huhifadhi payload, huzuia duplicate, na huita Pesapal <code>GetTransactionStatus</code> kabla ya status kubadilika.</p><div class="card"><div class="method">POST / GET</div><div class="route">/api/payments/webhooks/pesapal/accounts/{account-uuid}</div></div><p>Browser callback: <code>/api/payments/callback/pesapal/accounts/{account-uuid}</code>. Usichukulie redirect kama confirmation ya payment.</p><h2 id="statuses">Payment statuses</h2><p><code>COMPLETED → paid</code>, <code>FAILED / INVALID → failed</code>, na <code>REVERSED → cancelled</code>. PIN/password wrong, insufficient balance, au decline ya payment method hutambuliwa na Pesapal na status yake verified kupitia IPN/callback.</p><h2 id="expiry">Expiry & cancellation</h2><p>Pending payment hupata expiry ya dakika 30 by default (`PAYMENT_PENDING_EXPIRY_MINUTES`). Scheduler huverify status na Pesapal kwanza; ikiwa bado pending, hutuma <code>CancelOrder</code> na local status inakuwa <code>expired</code>. Weka cPanel cron: <code>php /home/CPANEL_USER/konekti-malipo/artisan schedule:run</code> kila dakika moja.</p></article></main></div></body></html>
